<title>INDIA: INDIA KOTHARI PIONEER MMMF YIELD AT 10.00 PERCENT.</title>
<headline>INDIA KOTHARI PIONEER MMMF YIELD AT 10.00 PERCENT.</headline>
<dateline>BOMBAY 1997-08-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Kothari Pioneer Mutual Fund said on Monday rate on its money market mutual fund (MMMF) yield as on August 12 was 10.00 percent and the daily rate was 0.000278985 rupees.</p>
<p>Kothari Pioneer Mutual Fund is a joint venture between India's Kothari Group and U.S. mutual fund Pioneer Inc.</p>
<p>The following are the Net Asset Value (NAV) for Kothari Pioneer's</p>
<p>other mutual funds.</p>
<p>-------</p>
<p>    Name of Fund				NAV(Rs.per share)</p>
<p>    ------------				-----------------</p>
<p>    Prima fund					 10.99</p>
<p>    Prima plus					  8.21</p>
<p>    Bluechip fund				    14.31</p>
<p>    Taxshield	95				 8.77</p>
<p>			 96				12.98</p>
<p>			 97				12.45</p>
<p>    Pension plan				     10.61</p>
<p>    Guaranted Income Plan - Annual	     11.00</p>
<p>				    Monthly	    10.36</p>
<p>-- Bombay newsroom +91-22-265 9000</p>
